About
================================================================================
TVHsync is a plugin for the EPG software TV-Browser. With TVHsync you can
manage the scheduled recordings (DVR entries) and the finished recordings of a
tvheadend server directly from TV-Browser.

TVHsync is based on the plugin Lazy Bones by Henrik Niehaus, which does the same
for a VDR (https://github.com/hampelratte/lazybones). TVHsync is not affiliated
with or endorsed by the Lazy Bones project.


Requirements
================================================================================
 * Java 11 or newer
 * TV-Browser >= 4.2.3
 * tvheadend 4.2 or newer with the HTTP API enabled (default)


Installation / Configuration
================================================================================
For the installation read the INSTALL file.


